<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header centered"><span class="eyebrow">The Quiet Arcade</span><h1>Not games to win. Rooms to enter and softly return from.</h1><p>Choose by nervous-system state, not by productivity. You can skip, swap, rest or leave.</p></div>
  <div class="room-grid">
    <% Object.entries(rooms).forEach(([key,room],i)=>{ %><a class="room-card room-<%= key %>" href="<%= key==='carry'?'/community':'/rooms/'+key %>"><span class="room-number">0<%= i+1 %></span><div class="room-icon"><%= key==='calm'?'✦':key==='ground'?'◉':key==='rest'?'◒':key==='return'?'⌂':'◇' %></div><h2><%= room.title %></h2><strong><%= room.subtitle %></strong><p><%= room.state %></p><% if(gameCounts && gameCounts[key]){ %><span class="room-game-count"><%= gameCounts[key] %> gentle game<%= gameCounts[key]===1?'':'s' %></span><% } %><span class="room-enter">Enter softly →</span></a><% }) %>
  </div><div class="ethical-note wide-note"><strong>There are no fail states here.</strong> No public ranking, scarcity timer, streak loss, forced daily logging or endless feed.</div>
</section>
